# stark_input options, shown in the single STARK menu: main/Kconfig.projbuild
# sources this file (ARCHITECTURE.md §9). ESP-IDF does not pick up a
# `Kconfig.stark` on its own, so the menu is assembled in one place.

config STARK_INPUT_POLL_MS
    int "Key sampling period (ms)"
    default 5
    help
        Period of the esp_timer that samples the six key GPIOs and runs
        the debounce/repeat core (components/stark_input). The debounce,
        long-press and repeat timings are separate constants in
        input_core.h and do not depend on this. ARCHITECTURE.md §6.6, §9.
